      * RPG III file operations and KLIST (FREE-08)
     H
     FORDERS  UF  E           K        DISK
     FCUSTMAS IF  E           K        DISK                           UC
      * KLIST is used where it is defined later too
     C           KEYORD    CHAINORDERS               90
     C                     UPDATORDERS                 92
     C           KEYORD    SETGTORDERS               93
     C                     READPORDERS                   94
     C           CUSTNO    REDPEORDERS                   95
     C           KEYORD    DELETORDERS               96
     C                     WRITEORDERS
     C                     OPEN CUSTMAS                97
     C           CUSTNO    CHAINCUSTMAS
     C                     CLOSECUSTMAS
     C                     FEOD ORDERS
     C                     UNLCKORDERS
     C           KEYORD    KLIST
     C                     KFLD           CUSTNO
     C                     KFLD           ORDNO
     C           ONEKEY    KLIST
     C                     KFLD           CUSTNO
     C           ONEKEY    SETLLORDERS
      * Not converted
     C                     WRITEORDERS                   98
     C           KEYBAD    CHAINORDERS
     C           KEYBAD    KLIST
     C                     KFLD           'X'
